// `jade check` must reject an import that names nothing.
//
// Until v1.1.33 this file reported `ok` and then failed at run time with
// "cannot find import", because import resolution was not a compile stage:
// the VM resolved a `use` when the Import opcode executed, long after check
// had finished. A checker that passes files which cannot load is not a gate.
use totally_made_up_module

print(totally_made_up_module.anything())
